This is the code used in the proof of Theorem 7: For every planar graph G on n ≤ 9 vertices 
we have wbt(G) = wbt2(G), that is, there exists a 2-page book embedding that realizes wbt(G).

To build it you need a C++ compiler such as GCC, cmake V3.1+ (https://cmake.org/), and OGDF.
This has been tested with the latest OGDF release, which can be obtained at 
https://www.ogdf.uni-osnabrueck.de/2025/10/27/foxglove/.

* Edit CMakeLists.txt and replace "/opt/local/OGDF" in Line 2 by your OGDF directory.
* Run "cmake . ; make ; ./run_plagen".
